1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,000
FOR THE RECORD
For the record, this is why I did it.

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:15,000
A private Android journal for the reasons
behind your work and wallet decisions.

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:22,000
Start with a project and one clear intention.

4
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:29,000
Core work journaling needs
no account, wallet or network.

5
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:35,000
What do I want to move forward today?

6
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:42,000
Choose a focus duration and begin.

7
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:49,000
Pause deliberately or finish early.

8
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:55,000
A timer ending does not automatically
save a result or award progress.

9
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:03,000
Finish early for this demonstration.
Record what actually happened.

10
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:11,000
A blocked attempt can be a useful record too.

11
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:20,000
Leave a next action,
so the next visit has a starting point.

12
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:28,000
The project book keeps the history.

13
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:34,000
Revisit or edit your own writing.

14
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:40,000
JSON export gives you a portable copy.

15
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:47,000
English is the default.
Settings offer eight language choices.

16
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:53,000
Your own writing keeps its original language.

17
00:01:53,000 --> 00:02:00,000
Motion, haptics and reminders are optional.

18
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:08,000
The Solana extension connects supported
wallet activity to a private reflection.

19
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:15,000
Reason. Plan. Emotion. Next action.

20
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:23,000
Native Mobile Wallet Adapter and public RPC
support a direct read-only journal path.

21
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:30,000
No paid backend is required for the journal.
Real-wallet validation still remains.

22
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:38,000
Private notes stay on the device.
Chain facts and reflection stay separate.

23
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:45,000
Unsupported activity stays unsupported.
The journal does not execute trades.

24
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:52,000
The offline workflow is ready to try.
Physical-device and live Solana evidence remain.

25
00:02:52,000 --> 00:03:00,000
FOR THE RECORD
Keep the reason for your next decision.
